.TH DEQ 1 "" "deq 1.0.0-rc.1" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deq \- Draw Deq shapes, traditional Kurdish tattoo motifs, as SVG, PDF and images
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deq
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Draw Deq shapes, traditional Kurdish tattoo motifs, as SVG, PDF and images.
The Node.js, Python and Rust tools share this interface.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
List the shapes in the catalog.
.TP
.B info
Show a shape's names, layers and parameters.
.TP
.B render
Render shapes to files.
.TP
.B export
Export shapes in several formats and sizes.
.TP
.B flag
Draw the flag of Kurdistan.
.TP
.B leet
Write text with Deq glyphs (Deq Leet), or read it back with --decode.
.TP
.B generate
Generate a seeded pattern of Deq motifs.
.TP
.B validate
Check a shape spec file and render every parameter variant.
.TP
.B completion
Print a shell completion script.
.SH OPTIONS
These options work with every command.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print the version.
